        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>MNG 177-VA, Vanilla Guerlain 5 Inch Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in satin antique nickel, polished nickel, and oil rubbed bronze finishes, the Guerlain 5 Inch Cabinet Pull is stunning for any traditional kitchen. The Vanilla Guerlain 5 Inch Cabinet Pull features a hobnail design that is unique and eye catching. This 5 inch cabinet pull is 5-1/4 inches overall and is a perfect fit for most grips at 3/8 inches. This Vanilla Collection cabinet handle comes packaged with the mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet pull is part of the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=MNG+Vanilla\">MNG Vanilla Collection</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the MNG 177 Guerlain 5 Inch Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Material: Zinc </li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screws and 1-1/2\"  long #8-32 screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i> \r\n</p>",
